  "findings": "Conditional on a realized initial count x0, each coordinate changes by at most n_step over n_step native steps. For constant immigration, its native terminal law is exactly Binomial(n_step,1-exp(-rate*(1-eps)/n_step)), while the continuous-time process is Poisson(rate*(1-eps)). Oracle bias demonstrates a need to check sampling resolution; it does not establish bias magnitude for a learned ALZ model.",
